{"id": "d01", "note": "“它”指人格面具", "turns": [{"question": "荣格说的人格面具是什么？", "answer": "人格面具是个体为了适应社会、扮演社会角色而戴上的面具，它看起来像个性，其实属于集体心理。", "expected": [{"book": "Collected Papers on Analytical Psychology", "chapter": "CHAPTER XIV / XV", "evidence": ["persona"]}]}, {"question": "它对一个人的心理健康有什么影响？", "expected": [{"book": "Collected Papers on Analytical Psychology", "chapter": "CHAPTER XIV / XV", "evidence": ["persona"]}]}]}
{"id": "d02", "note": "“它”指梦的稽查，追问换到另一个梦的机制", "turns": [{"question": "弗洛伊德说的梦的稽查是什么？", "answer": "梦的稽查是阻止不被接受的愿望直接进入梦中的一种力量，它让梦的内容变得扭曲、难以理解。", "expected": [{"book": "A General Introduction to Psychoanalysis", "chapter": "NINTH LECTURE", "evidence": ["dream censor", "censorship"]}]}, {"question": "那它和凝缩作用有什么关系？", "expected": [{"book": "A General Introduction to Psychoanalysis", "chapter": "ELEVENTH LECTURE", "evidence": ["condensation"]}, {"book": "The Interpretation of Dreams", "chapter": "VI THE DREAM-WORK", "evidence": ["condensation"]}]}]}
{"id": "d03", "note": "“他”指荣格，“这个方法”指联想实验", "turns": [{"question": "荣格的字词联想实验是怎么做的？", "answer": "实验者念出一个刺激词，被试尽快说出想到的第一个词，同时记录反应时间和之后的再现情况。", "expected": [{"book": "Collected Papers on Analytical Psychology", "chapter": "LECTURE I", "evidence": ["reaction time", "stimulus word"]}]}, {"question": "他用这个方法查出过小偷吗？", "expected": [{"book": "Collected Papers on Analytical Psychology", "chapter": "LECTURE I", "evidence": ["theft"]}]}]}
{"id": "d04", "note": "省略主语：追问的是另一类失误", "turns": [{"question": "弗洛伊德怎么解释口误？", "answer": "弗洛伊德认为口误不是偶然的，而是两种意图互相干扰的结果，有它自己的意义。", "expected": [{"book": "A General Introduction to Psychoanalysis", "chapter": "SECOND–FOURTH LECTURE", "evidence": ["slips of the tongue", "slip of the tongue"]}]}, {"question": "那忘记别人的名字呢，也是一样的道理吗？", "expected": [{"book": "A General Introduction to Psychoanalysis", "chapter": "SECOND–FOURTH LECTURE", "evidence": ["proper names"]}]}]}
{"id": "d05", "note": "“他”指荣格，“这个概念”指力比多", "turns": [{"question": "荣格为什么不同意弗洛伊德对力比多的理解？", "answer": "荣格认为把力比多只理解为性欲太狭窄，他想把它扩展成更一般的心理能量。", "expected": [{"book": "The Theory of Psychoanalysis", "chapter": "CHAPTER III", "evidence": ["libido"]}]}, {"question": "那他自己是怎么定义这个概念的？", "expected": [{"book": "The Theory of Psychoanalysis", "chapter": "CHAPTER III", "evidence": ["energic"]}, {"book": "Psychology of the Unconscious", "chapter": "CHAPTER II / III", "evidence": ["energy"]}]}]}
{"id": "d06", "note": "“对应的情况”指俄狄浦斯情结在女孩身上的对应", "turns": [{"question": "什么是俄狄浦斯情结？", "answer": "俄狄浦斯情结指男孩在童年时对母亲产生依恋、把父亲当作竞争对手的心理。", "expected": [{"book": "A General Introduction to Psychoanalysis", "chapter": "TWENTY-FIRST LECTURE", "evidence": ["Oedipus"]}]}, {"question": "女孩身上有对应的情况吗？荣格管它叫什么？", "expected": [{"book": "The Theory of Psychoanalysis", "chapter": "CHAPTER VII", "evidence": ["Electra"]}]}]}
{"id": "d07", "note": "“后一种”指神经症焦虑，必须从上一轮回答里读出来", "turns": [{"question": "弗洛伊德怎么看待焦虑？", "answer": "弗洛伊德把焦虑分成两种：一种是对外界真实危险的现实焦虑，另一种是神经症焦虑。", "expected": [{"book": "A General Introduction to Psychoanalysis", "chapter": "TWENTY-FIFTH LECTURE", "evidence": ["real fear", "neurotic fear"]}]}, {"question": "后一种是怎么产生的？", "expected": [{"book": "A General Introduction to Psychoanalysis", "chapter": "TWENTY-FIFTH LECTURE", "evidence": ["neurotic fear"]}]}]}
